WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.336
Every Israeli town makes health decisions.

2
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:07.312
The facts are open data, scattered across
many institutions.

3
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.806
Ask a chatbot, and it may invent the number.

4
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:13.749
In public health, that is dangerous.

5
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.113
So we built a room.

6
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:22.635
CityPulse files the official data once:
every locality, every indicator.

7
00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:25.450
Fourteen hundred ninety-four localities.

8
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.450
Forty-one indicators.

9
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:29.650
Eleven official sources.

10
00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:33.263
Meet the orchestrator, a watsonx Orchestrate
agent.

11
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:37.760
A health officer asks it, in Hebrew, where
Sderot is weakest.

12
00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:42.878
It does not guess. Tool one, from our
OpenAPI file, finds the town.

13
00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:46.361
Tool two asks the room.

14
00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:51.454
The folder returns sealed. Every figure is
final.

15
00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:55.694
The model words the answer, but cannot
change a number.

16
00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:58.409
If it tries, the guard rejects it.

17
00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:02.500
Behind the room is the product.

18
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:06.494
Search any locality, and one page tells the
story.

19
00:01:08.850 --> 00:01:12.200
Fourteen of twenty-six health indicators
need attention.

20
00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:13.793
What is going well.

21
00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:15.395
What changed.

22
00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:18.350
How it compares with similar towns.

23
00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:20.013
And what to do first.

24
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:24.158
Where the data is missing, it says so.

25
00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:29.631
Ask in plain language.

26
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:37.678
The AI decides which evidence to show, and
every figure comes from the data.

27
00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:44.749
Compare two towns side by side.

28
00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:50.515
Print a two-page report for the local
authority.

29
00:01:50.700 --> 00:01:53.845
And see how every indicator moved over the
years.

30
00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:56.797
And here is the Orchestrate agent itself.

31
00:01:57.100 --> 00:02:04.007
Same question, same figures: fifty-one point
nine percent, rank one sixty-seven of one
eighty-seven.

32
00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:11.705
Every number matches the API, because the
agent is told to copy, never to round.

33
00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:22.725
IBM Bob built the server layer: caching,
security headers, validation, share pages,
CSV export.

34
00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:26.867
Fourteen tasks. Forty-nine Bobcoins.

35
00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:31.554
The data model and the screens: built by our
team.

36
00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:37.199
From open data, through one API, to people
and to AI agents.

37
00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:44.337
It runs on Cloudflare's edge, with a spend
guard on every AI call, and eight hundred
forty-eight automated tests.

38
00:02:44.450 --> 00:02:47.247
The same pattern fits any open dataset.

39
00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:53.035
CityPulse. Trustworthy public-health data,
ready for people and for AI agents.
